translate turkish welchp5_17eb3a33:

    # sst "I don't think that my answer to this question is going to be as interesting as you think it might be."
    sst "Bu soruya vereceğim cevabın, senin düşündüğün kadar ilginç olacağını sanmıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:15
translate turkish welchp5_b9bc6f1d:

    # sst "My sluttiness is a relatively new development."
    sst "Sürtüklüğüm nispeten yeni bir gelişme."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:17
translate turkish welchp5_19e510e4:

    # sst "Until I was 30 years old I only had sex with one guy. My ex-husband."
    sst "30 yaşına kadar sadece bir erkekle seks yaptım. Eski kocamla."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:18
translate turkish welchp5_57bd83e9:

    # sst "And that was really just a few pumps in bed before sleep."
    sst "Ve o da aslında yatakta uyumadan önce birkaç kez girip çıkmaktan ibaretti."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:20
translate turkish welchp5_ac465320:

    # sst "The weirdest place I've ever had sex is easily in my classroom. With you."
    sst "Şimdiye kadar seks yaptığım en tuhaf yer, hiç şüphesiz sınıfımdı. Seninle."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:22
translate turkish welchp5_138bbc95:

    # sst "I still can't believe we did that."
    sst "Hâlâ bunu yaptığıma inanamıyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:23
translate turkish welchp5_2ffc1578:

    # sst "I've had sex with other guys... some women too... but I haven't been very adventurous when it comes to location."
    sst "Başka erkeklerle de seks yaptım... bazı kadınlarla da... ama yer konusunda pek maceracı olmadım."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:25
translate turkish welchp5_561d970e:

    # sst "I like my bed. I like my privacy."
    sst "Yatağımı seviyorum. Mahremiyetimi seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:27
translate turkish welchp5_cd6dd9f1:

    # sst "I like being loud."
    sst "Gürültücü olmayı seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:28
translate turkish welchp5_742dd378:

    # pc "I like it when you're loud too."
    pc "Senin de gürültücü olmanı seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:29
translate turkish welchp5_2cb82d8f:

    # sst "I like when you make me loud."
    sst "Beni gürültücü yapmanı seviyorum."

# game/Scenes/Welch/WelchConversations/welchp5.rpy:30
translate turkish welchp5_fbf878b4:

    # sst "I hope you'll make me loud tonight."
    sst "Umarım bu gece beni gürültücü yaparsın."

